# Docker build context filter for the MAGGuarantee monorepo.
#
# Build context is `magguarantee-app/` (this directory). Paths here are
# relative to it. Files outside this directory (Code.gs, index.html, docs/)
# are already outside the build context — they don't need to be listed.

# ── Dependencies (re-installed in the deps stage via `npm ci`) ──────────────
**/node_modules

# ── Build outputs (re-generated in the build stage) ────────────────────────
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/build
**/out

# ── Test / coverage artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output
**/test-results
**/playwright-report

# ── Secrets — MUST NEVER end up in an image ────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*

# ── Logs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ── Local docker / compose artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────
# The dev compose file is for local development — not needed inside images.
docker-compose.yml
docker-compose.*.yml

# ── OS / editor cruft ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ── Git (defensive — not in the magguarantee-app/ context anyway) ─────────
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# ── Prisma local-only artifacts ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Generated client is rebuilt inside the image; ignore any stale local copy.
packages/database/src/generated
